# Per-fit outputs from try_fit / the stepwise fitter: one set per hashed fit, thousands of
# them under e23035_analysis/tpc_spectrum_fitting/*/. The .root files are already covered by
# *.root above. The 8-hex-digit hash is spelled out so these cannot match a hand-named file.
#   fit_<hash>.csv, fit_<hash>_evaluated.csv, fit_<hash>_evaluated_calibrated.csv
#   fit_<hash>_info.json
#   peaks_<parent hash>_<operation>_<digest>.csv   (guess lists for modified fits)
#   calibration_<hash>.csv
# Deliberately NOT ignored: hand-maintained peak lists (proton_peaks.csv, alpha_peaks.csv,
# core_peaks.csv, p914.csv, ...), study summaries (sigma_anchors.json, generous.json,
# overnight_results*.json, multiplet_tests.json, run9_start.json), decisions*.jsonl,
# ledger.csv, stepwise_config.json and the run logs.
fit_[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*.csv
fit_[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*.json
peaks_[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*.csv
calibration_[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*.csv
